<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai security forces have killed an insurgent trainer in Yala and a suspect in a separate Yala gunfight, both near the Malaysian border, while an insurgent was also killed in a Yala security operation close to Malaysia. The Thai Air Force scrambled F-16 fighter jets to the Tak border in response to cross-border attacks from Myanmar, and evacuation centres are being prepared for possible refugee flows from Myanmar. Thailand has received KB‑5E drones after a reported debut on the Cambodia border and has stepped up cybersecurity measures following European hacks. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQR2l1eVhINzRnM2ZQSV91YnN3M3IxbUdreEMyTkQ1QWhIMWhxcEtmOHlRc1p1SC0yYUtYeXFtaE04WG9qaXltRF9hUFVJbW1QVFNyb2tDSWRzbjh4dXZXZmhJNWZ2SlBNX3pDOGUtR2xJOS1PU0puWVpiWHY0NFFoTW13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBPOTF0TGJPbUZJQ0Ywb3Z3Zzh0ajZRbmtnYW1GTlplLWJsNndEcVQyLXFXY2c0SGZvbkd3RDlQX0IxRnp1WnZKMHJzQldNQWZ5LW16cDBxV1ItTHM5WGVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNZ3FxUFJ5VVhEQzQ3U2VVLVJJaGlLSU5RRlc3U1g4Wkt5SXI3QW9iREhCTjZvenBZOTE4OGxqaTF0aW1nbGM3UW9ldkZvUEFQWWZjZml2VW1kQi1QNF9nWGFleTRmWThLelNHVHk5cVl2NWxhUTcwbkE0UldUZnQ1Wnp0OHhfcDRxLXIydThadTZpZnNzNFhaQ3hIWUxjbFlpVVRyVDl6aTRNN0U2a0hqTXNLQnN3Y3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOYXU4bHAtOHJWbUk1Y2xaUDJDbnpnWC1tQzNhYWtiME1yRXE1TEt1UTFlTHlzNmJfYTFGdDFkd2J3MU9QQ2hHV0tEZFoyYXRhRlg4aUNpTGJUMHl2R2daaE1wNEFBMURER3JwQXljeTFWMTA3Q2FjYVNmYzdYc1FVWTkzanMyOUxuNGhlOE5QWjVwcDJWVUJLbEh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Carz 